note sites: found by a one-token change of a tracked program; reaches the omc error site in rdval (code 7)
note clock: time, identity and randomness; no file, network or process words.
text ok "clock\n"
fn main to int
t = monons
p = getpid
b = new uchar 8 0
r = random b 0 8 0
if or le t f64 le p 0
ret 1
end
w = write 1 ok 0 len ok
ret 0
end
